{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はリハ、リハ、リハ、リハの日々ですわ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この暑い暑い夏にダラッダラに汗流しながら頑張っておるよだ。みんな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたくしめは汗があまり出ないので\nみんなみたいに滝汗かくために最近は無駄に踊りをでかくして汗をかこうと必死なの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"zeppツアー初日の札幌公演まであと残りわずか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集中中だー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/15/7853331/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夜は真洋の家にチームD集結して朝の4時まで語り明かした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそのせいでちょっと今日眠かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません、夜更かしやめます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しいですそういうの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若いんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/15/7853331/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未（18）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近七瀬と変な声を出すのにハマってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あんもうんもくろうんも」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これよく言い合うの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかしいでしょ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もリハがんばります(*^_^*)"}],"source":"archive"}